:: MP Guild Assembly More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
钟楼三层联席厅后墙的窄门通向文书房，褪色绒板上钉着六叠待办案卷。执事管这里叫议事别册：现行工钱乘数 <<print $mpGuildStanding.wageMod>>%，夜禁加减 <<print $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod>>，闸税加减 <<print $mpGuildStanding.tollMod>>，百工 <<print $mpGuildStanding.crafts>>、海港 <<print $mpGuildStanding.docks>>、侍奉 <<print $mpGuildStanding.service>>、暗流 <<print $mpGuildStanding.underground>>。拉票、罢工与封闸归在前案，请愿、暗桩与复议归在后案。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回行会总枢 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[翻前案街铺卷 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[查看后案复议卷 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub B]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[收束本届议事别册 (0:03)|MP Guild Assembly Extra Outcome]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Assembly More Hub A [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
文书房前案摆着三叠街面急卷：十二家铺面还没走完的登门拉票木牌、面包房与咖啡馆伙计联名递上的停业罢工禀帖，以及旧港税吏扣住外海货船的码头封闸放行条。执事把铜钉盒推到你手边，说先办哪一件，另外两件的风向也会跟着偏。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[逐店登门拉票 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Extra 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link [[调停三店铺罢工 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Extra 2]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<docksicon>><<link [[处置旧港码头封闸 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Extra 3]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Assembly More Hub B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
文书房后案压着三叠深层案卷：百工匠人按满红手印的护薪请愿书、信差与马厩暗桩留下的夜间门牌抄件，以及被联席长桌退回来待复议的旧议案。窗外海雾贴着玻璃，楼下卸货的号子一阵高一阵低，执事让你挑一叠先落笔。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[接收工匠请愿 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Extra 4]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[核查地下暗桩卷 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Extra 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[提请旧议案复议卷 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Extra 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Assembly Extra 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
偏厢矮桌上摊着十二枚写着铺名的薄木牌：当前面包 <<print $mpGuildStanding.bakery>>、咖啡 <<print $mpGuildStanding.cafe>>、鱼档 <<print $mpGuildStanding.fish>>、浴场 <<print $mpGuildStanding.spa>>、马厩 <<print $mpGuildStanding.stable>>。木牌背面各有一道浅槽，谈成一户就嵌一枚铜钉。浴场管事认熟客，咖啡馆掌柜怕得罪东家，马厩老板留老伙计看门，得挑准门路登门。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前案 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[挨家登门拉票 (0:14)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($english or 0) gte 220 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 200>><<mpGuildAdd "bakery" 5>><<mpGuildAdd "cafe" 5>><<mpGuildAdd "fish" 4>><<mpGuildAdd "spa" 4>><<mpStandingAdd "guilds" 2>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link [[请各掌柜喝一杯 (0:10)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 200 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 200>><<mpGuildAdd "cafe" 6>><<mpGuildAdd "pubkitchen" 5>><<mpGuildAdd "clock" -4>><<mpFameAdd "charm" 2>><<tiredness 1>><<stress 1>><<else>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[托暗流递口头密话 (0:10)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($sneak or 0) gte 180 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 200>><<mpGuildAdd "courier" 6>><<mpGuildAdd "stable" 5>><<mpGuildAdd "bakery" -4>><<mpFameAdd "underworld" 2>><<tiredness 1>><<else>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Assembly Extra 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
面包房、咖啡馆与洗衣房的伙计同时停了手里的活，把湿布和冷铜壶堆在门槛内侧。当前工钱乘数 <<print $mpGuildStanding.wageMod>>%，百工与侍奉两帮在街心僵持不下：伙计要保底工钱与轮休，东家怕亏空不肯先垫第一笔。执事送来空白班表与让步条，等你出面收场。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前案 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[居中调停签条 (0:14)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($english or 0) gte 220 or ($tending or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpGuildStanding.wageMod to Math.min(120, ($mpGuildStanding.wageMod or 100) + 4)>><<mpGuildAdd "bakery" 6>><<mpGuildAdd "cafe" 6>><<mpGuildAdd "fish" -4>><<mpGuildAdd "stable" -4>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -2>><<else>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpbargainicon>><<link [[替东家压下停业 (0:12)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpGuildStanding.wageMod to Math.max(85, ($mpGuildStanding.wageMod or 100) - 5)>><<mpGuildAdd "clock" 5>><<mpGuildAdd "fish" 5>><<mpGuildAdd "bakery" -6>><<mpGuildAdd "cafe" -6>><<mpGuildAdd "laundry" -4>><<mpStandingAdd "docks" 2>><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[把亏空折进季度账 (0:12)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpGuildStanding.wageMod to Math.min(120, ($mpGuildStanding.wageMod or 100) + 2)>><<mpGuildAdd "laundry" 5>><<mpGuildAdd "tailor" 5>><<mpGuildAdd "pubkitchen" 4>><<mpGuildAdd "bakery" 2>><<mpStandingAdd "guilds" 2>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Assembly Extra 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
旧港闸口值房外堵着三船带冰的鲜鱼与外海干柴，税吏拿着新换的木牌，说现行闸税加减 <<print $mpGuildStanding.tollMod>>，海港席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.docks>>、百工席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.crafts>>，不交齐加征费就不起铁链。船主急得跳脚，再堵半个时辰整船鲜鱼就要臭在舱里。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前案 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<docksicon>><<link [[连夜开闸放货 (0:14)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 220 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 200>><<mpGuildVote "toll" "cut">><<mpGuildAdd "trawler" 6>><<mpGuildAdd "fish" 5>><<mpGuildAdd "tailor" -5>><<mpGuildAdd "stable" -4>><<tiredness 2>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[支持加征护港税 (0:10)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 10>><<mpGuildVote "toll" "raise">><<mpGuildAdd "tailor" 6>><<mpGuildAdd "courier" 5>><<mpGuildAdd "trawler" -5>><<mpGuildAdd "pubkitchen" -4>><<mpStandingAdd "underworld" 2>><<stress 1>><<tiredness 1>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[替船主买通老税吏 (0:12)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub A]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 220>><<set $mpGuildStanding.tollMod to -4>><<mpGuildAdd "fish" 4>><<mpGuildAdd "trawler" 4>><<mpGuildAdd "clock" -3>><<mpFameAdd "underworld" 2>><<stress 2>><<else>><<stress 4>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Assembly Extra 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
百工帮的老匠人捧来一卷按满红手印的请愿书，现行工钱乘数 <<print $mpGuildStanding.wageMod>>%，百工席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.crafts>>。他们要求把学徒护薪与炉料津贴写进联席正册，否则下月就不再替市政厅检修街灯与水闸。执事让你决定怎样处置这份请愿卷。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回后案 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub B]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
