:: MP Guild Assembly Extra 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
信差站与马厩送来一叠沾着煤灰的暗桩门牌抄件，记着夜禁加减 <<print $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod>>，信差 <<print $mpGuildStanding.courier>>、马厩 <<print $mpGuildStanding.stable>>、农庄 <<print $mpGuildStanding.farm>>。抄件标出了城里几处夜间走私过货的后门，既能借它递密信放宽夜路，也能抄走名册交给巡夜队换取明面资历。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回后案 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub B]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
