<<investigateicon>><<link [[抄名册移交巡夜 (0:14)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub B]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod to Math.max(-3, ($mpGuildStanding.curfewMod or 0) - 1)>><<mpGuildAdd "courier" -6>><<mpGuildAdd "stable" -6>><<mpGuildAdd "farm" -4>><<mpGuildAdd "clock" 5>><<mpGuildAdd "fish" 5>><<mpFameAdd "combat" 3>><<mpStandingAdd "guilds" 3>><<stress -2>><<tiredness 2>><<else>><<stress 5>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[替暗桩守紧口风事 (0:10)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub B]]>><<pass 10>><<mpGuildAdd "courier" 3>><<mpGuildAdd "stable" 3>><<mpGuildAdd "farm" 3>><<mpFameAdd "underworld" 3>><<mpStandingAdd "underworld" 3>><<mpStandingAdd "guilds" -2>><<stress 1>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Assembly Extra 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
绒板最底下压着被长桌退回的复议案卷：工钱乘数 <<print $mpGuildStanding.wageMod>>%，夜禁加减 <<print $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod>>，闸税加减 <<print $mpGuildStanding.tollMod>>。执事说，只要能拿出新算出来的成本细账或补齐四帮附署，就能趁今日休会前把其中一桩旧案翻过来重判。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回后案 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub B]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
