:: MP Guild Assembly Extra Outcome [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
六叠纸办完，文书房绒板空了大半。执事把三枚铜印并排摆上矮柜：百工席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.crafts>> 够厚可入百工宪章，海港席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.docks>> 够厚可立自由港盟约，暗流席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.underground>> 够厚可记入煤窖夜账。三页不能同时落印，落定一页，其余两页便压回箱底。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回别册 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpGuildEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldGuildOutcome is "charter">><<shopicon>><<link [[复核百工宪章 (0:06)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -2>><</link>><<elseif $mpWorldGuildOutcome is "freeport">><<docksicon>><<link [[复核自由港盟约 (0:06)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[复核煤窖夜账 (0:06)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub]]>><<pass 6>><<stress -2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<else>>
<<shopicon>><<link [[誊百工宪章 (0:16)|MP Guild Ending Charter]]>><<pass 16>><<stress -4>><</link>><br>
<<docksicon>><<link [[誊自由港盟约 (0:16)|MP Guild Ending FreePort]]>><<pass 16>><<stress -4>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[誊暗流煤窖夜账 (0:16)|MP Guild Ending Shadow]]>><<pass 16>><<stress -4>><</link>><br>
<</if>>
<<if not ($mpWorldGuildQuarterLocked or 0)>><<link [[进季度联席法案桌 (0:08)|MP Guild Quarter Proposal]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Guild Quarter Docks [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
海港帮廊台高挂着生锈的船锚旧旗，鱼档老板与拖网船主正围着潮汐图核对水位。当前雾潮停在 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>> 格，海港席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.docks>>。他们表示只要季度法案准许雾夜免检卸货窗，海港三席便立刻在草案上按手印；若坚持原闸查验，海港绝不附议。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回提案 (0:02)|MP Guild Quarter Proposal]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<docksicon>><<link [[应允雾夜卸货窗 (0:10)|MP Guild Quarter Crafts]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpGuildQStanceDocks to 1>><<mpGuildAdd "fish" 5>><<stress -2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[拒批免检维持原闸 (0:10)|MP Guild Quarter Crafts]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpGuildQStanceDocks to 0>><<stress 2>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Quarter Crafts [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
百工帮廊台下摆着沉甸甸的铁锤铜牌，面包师傅与钟表匠正翻看全城燃料与面粉价签。当前物价指数为 <<print ($mpWorldPriceMod or 100)>>%，百工席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.crafts>>。他们要求将学徒护薪条款写进季度总案，免得年轻匠人被高物价逼得改行；若只顾压低料钱，百工帮便留着票不投。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回提案 (0:02)|MP Guild Quarter Proposal]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[写入学徒护薪条 (0:10)|MP Guild Quarter Service]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpGuildQStanceCrafts to 1>><<mpGuildAdd "bakery" 5>><<stress -2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[暂压津贴先保料钱 (0:10)|MP Guild Quarter Service]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpGuildQStanceCrafts to 0>><<stress 2>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Quarter Service [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
侍奉帮廊台点着温茶铜炉，浴场管事与咖啡馆掌柜正议论神殿香油与晚班客流。神殿那边眼下<<if $mpTempleOrder is "orthodox">>由净火正统掌着调子<<elseif $mpTempleOrder is "reform">>让慈悲圣所开了声<<elseif $mpTempleOrder is "concord">>按双生调和共管<<else>>还没定下归属<</if>>，侍奉席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.service>>。只要准许晚班留灯配额，侍奉帮便肯投赞成票。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回提案 (0:02)|MP Guild Quarter Proposal]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[准许晚班留灯配额 (0:10)|MP Guild Quarter Underworld]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpGuildQStanceService to 1>><<mpGuildAdd "spa" 5>><<stress -2>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[转赴暗流廊台 (0:08)|MP Guild Quarter Underworld]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpGuildQStanceService to 0>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Quarter Underworld [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
暗流帮廊台隐在钟楼三层的背光处，信差头目与马厩管事正低声核对孤儿院周债风声。眼下周债逾期 <<print ($mpLedger and $mpLedger.overdue) or 0>> 笔，暗流席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.underground>>。他们提出只要默许夜间急件板车免检过街，暗流三席便替你在唱票时压阵；若不给特权，便各自凭实力唱票。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回提案 (0:02)|MP Guild Quarter Proposal]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[默许急件夜车通行 (0:10)|MP Guild Quarter Vote]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpGuildQStanceUnder to 1>><<mpGuildAdd "courier" 5>><<stress -2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[拒给特权付唱票 (0:10)|MP Guild Quarter Vote]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpGuildQStanceUnder to 0>><<stress 2>><</link>>
